      <activity id="2bd6c760-880d-5d75-8989-885927d34454" activityNameId="1f1f6189-3b25-52e5-874c-140246b71124" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ethanol, 99.7% in H2O, from biomass, at distillation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ethanol, 99.7% in H2O, from biomass, at distillation
The inventory for "ethanol, 99.7% in H2O, from biomass, at distillation, CH" is modelled with ethanol production from sugar beets, whey and grass. The mix is assumed with the potentials of the Swiss ethanol production in the year 2007, which have been considered in  literature.;
CAS number: 000064-17-5; 
Formula: C2H6O ; 
Synonyms: Alkohol, alcohol dehydrated, algrain, Anhydrol, cologne spirit, cologne spirits (alcohol), Denatured alcohol, Ethyl alcohol, Ethanol, ethanol 200 proof, Ethanol absolute, ethyl hydrate, ethyl hydroxide, fermentation alcohol, grain alcohol; 
UUID: c183a9d5-c077-3055-9dfe-d8066babb750
Dewatering of ethanol 95% in H2O including ethanol mix Switzerland.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Switzerland.
Technology: Dewatering of ethanol
Time period: undefined
Production volume: World ethanol production was around 276 Mio hl in 2003.
Sampling: Literature data. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c183a9d5-c077-3055-9dfe-d8066babb750.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
